        <mxCell id="n" value="Each aggregate gets a position. It comes after everything that precedes it in a chain; aggregates that no chain separates keep the default order. An XSLT sorts by it. If two names get different positions, a chain must connect them; otherwise the ordering is rejected as not a strict weak order. A cycle is rejected too." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
